   <accessor type='XPath' value='byXPath(&quot;//main[@id=&apos;root&apos;]/article/main/article/section[2]/section/div[1]/div/table/tbody/tr/td[1]/div/p&quot;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='XPathClass' value='byXPath(&apos;//*[@class=&quot;leading-6 font-medium&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='XPathText' value='byXPath(&apos;//*[text()=&quot;A New Mobile Co&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='AbsoluteXPath' value='byXPath(&apos;/html/body/main/article/main/article/section[2]/section/div/div/table/tbody/tr/td/div/p&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='RelativeXPath' value='byXPath(&quot;id(&apos;root&apos;)/article[@class=&apos;flex min-h-screen flex-col&apos;]/main[@class=&apos;break-word flex-1 overflow-auto bg-background px-6 py-4 md:ml-16&apos;]/article[@class=&apos;w-full flex-1 bg-background&apos;]/section[2]/section[@class=&apos;space-y-3&apos;]/div[@class=&apos;rounded-md border shadow-sm&apos;]/div[@class=&apos;w-full overflow-auto rounded-lg bg-root&apos;]/table[@class=&apos;w-full caption-bottom font-mono text-sm&apos;]/tbody[@class=&apos;[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0&apos;]/tr[@class=&apos;border-b data-[state=selected]:bg-accent transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50&apos;]/td[@class=&apos;break-words p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0&apos;]/div[@class=&apos;w-fit&apos;]/p[@class=&apos;leading-6 font-medium&apos;]&quot;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='TableXPath' value='byXPath(&apos;//tbody//tr[1]//td[1]//div//p[@class=&quot;leading-6 font-medium&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='TableXPath' value='byXPath(&apos;//tbody//tr[1]//td[1]//div//p[text()=&quot;A New Mobile Co&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='JQuery' value='byJQuery(&apos;tbody[class=&quot;[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0&quot;] &gt; tr[class=&quot;border-b data-[state=selected]:bg-accent transition-colors hover:bg-muted/50&quot;] &gt; td[class=&quot;break-words p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0&quot;] &gt; div[class=&quot;w-fit&quot;] &gt; p[class=&quot;leading-6 font-medium&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
